## Recognition Policy

### Contributors Page
Everyone who contributes (no matter how small) will be recognized:
- Pull request mergers
- Issue reporters
- Documentation improvers
- Code contributors
- Research sharers

### Levels of Contribution
- ⭐ One-time contributor
- ⭐⭐ Regular contributor (3+ merged PRs)
- ⭐⭐⭐ Core contributor (10+ merged PRs)
- ⭐⭐⭐⭐ Maintainer candidate

## License Agreement

By contributing to this repository, you agree that:
- Your contributions will be in the public domain (same as dataset)
- You have the right to contribute the work
- You agree to the project's license terms

